* Chi-square tests.
CROSSTABS /TABLES=GenderCode BY Readmission30d /STATISTICS=CHISQ PHI /CELLS=COUNT ROW EXPECTED.
CROSSTABS /TABLES=DiagnosisCode BY FollowUpCompleted /STATISTICS=CHISQ /CELLS=COUNT ROW EXPECTED.
* Independent samples t-test.
T-TEST GROUPS=GenderCode(1 2) /VARIABLES=BMI /CRITERIA=CI(.95).
* One-way ANOVA.
ONEWAY BMI BY DiagnosisCode /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES HOMOGENEITY /POSTHOC=TUKEY.
* Correlation.
CORRELATIONS /VARIABLES=Age BMI SystolicBP DiastolicBP FastingGlucose /PRINT=TWOTAIL SIG.
* Multiple linear regression.
REGRESSION /DEPENDENT FastingGlucose /METHOD=ENTER Age BMI SystolicBP /STATISTICS COEFF R ANOVA COLLIN TOL.
* Binary logistic regression.
LOGISTIC REGRESSION VARIABLES Readmission30d
 /METHOD=ENTER Age BMI LengthOfStayDays /PRINT=CI(95) GOODFIT.
